From 4165048ee809d592ec82f308f6e55d5db7d6c915 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ivory <contact@ivory.cafe>
Date: Thu, 10 Sep 2026 21:43:56 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 16/21] r0dump: add opt-in nterp method-entry capture point

Gate a NterpR0dumpMethodEntry trampoline behind
g_r0dump_nterp_method_entry_enabled in START_EXECUTING_INSTRUCTIONS on
all five ABIs (arm64/arm/riscv64/x86_64/x86); disabled path branches over
the hook to the original body byte-for-byte. Add a source-contract test
asserting the disabled-gate symmetry across every ABI.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
Change-Id: I886f16348801377b867319cfbed327203da894d6
